# native sample  register  data
# The sustained AM carrier of perceptual_lfo.trace with its PM switched off
# (PMD 0, PMS 0), so the spectrum after the AM ends is a plain tone. The AM
# depth returns to zero mid-note and, later, the channel's AM sensitivity
# does too. Both edges must restore the carrier's full amplitude: a block AM
# pass that stops walking once the depth is zero leaves the last scaled gain
# pair in place and the note nearly muted.

0 18 a8
0 19 7f
0 19 80
0 1b 00
0 38 03
0 20 c7
0 28 4c
0 30 00
0 58 01
0 78 00
0 98 1f
0 b8 80
0 d8 00
0 f8 0f
0 08 40

# AM depth to zero with the sensitivity still 3
6000 19 00

# then the sensitivity itself to zero
11000 38 00
